        "created_at": "2018-11-23T21:10:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What becomes of reward equipment (Chekhov's Hairdryer, etc.) if a card (or combo) destroys the equipment. Does it still go under the incap heroes in that play area, for later reclamation?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
