      {
        "id": 224395,
        "name": "New Hero Confirmed",
        "username": "New_Hero_Confirmed",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/71c47a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-23T21:39:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If it's already been claimed as a reward in a character's play area, it would go in that character's discard.&nbsp; It would only go under a character's incap if it's destroyed due to that character being incapped or if that character is incapped while it's in their discard/hand/deck.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:57:46.961Z",
