      {
        "id": 224397,
        "name": "New Hero Confirmed",
        "username": "New_Hero_Confirmed",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/71c47a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-24T02:58:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Oh, you fish rewards out of the deck/trash after an incap? That’ll help with getting some of them back, in that case…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes.&nbsp; When a figure is destroyed, all Objectives go to the bottom of the Objective deck, all of that Character’s cards go back in the box (unless you’re playing another version of that Character, of course), and any Rewards your hand/play area/deck/trash go under the Incap for that Character.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:57:47.107Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
