      {
        "id": 224398,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-24T11:57:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Once you've earned them, Rewards basically count as your cards for the rest of the game (I think you pretend they have your card back rather than the Mission details, since they are no longer Mission cards but I don't think they count as Character cards), so if they are destroyed then yes, they go to your trash. And as mentioned above, if you are incapped then all your Rewards go under the incap card and you can choose to retrieve one as your pre-Start-phase action on each of your future turns.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:57:47.177Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
